          "passive_description": "<p>The mist has no moves of its own. It wears the shapes of whatever else walks the valley, and everything it borrows comes back through in <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>.</p>",
          "roll": "",
          "uuid": "Actor.8kluKkqkcGFkmXNO.Item.f6bn9d3f5NIdXbbA"
        },
        "vvdntvwGzqaQ3m41": {
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Illusory Form",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;the Mist Dragon suffers <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>&nbsp;damage</p></li></ul><p>Its body is a suggestion, not a thing — blades find nothing to bite. The wind scatters the shape until the <strong>end of the round</strong>, and it gathers again.</p>",
          "roll": "",
          "uuid": "Actor.8kluKkqkcGFkmXNO.Item.vvdntvwGzqaQ3m41"
        }
      },
